302f88df506?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b1a02f9dfd04e5579253ac3f1eb69c00, https://si.imgix.net/8da67c34/uploads/origins/bc543890-613e-4bea-aa1d-2302f88df506?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c4e71f4f4cc43708a2ed7be0e1467c04 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8da67c34/uploads/origins/bc543890-613e-4bea-aa1d-2302f88df506?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1f5c1f976bef4027601242ef4a38c810 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは、今日も良い一日をお過ごしでしょうか！  私はあなたが過去に私のために描いたアートワークが大好きです。私のキャラクター、ウンブリエル（参考文献はこちら：https://imgur.com/a/eSfvgCe）のアートを2枚描いていただけないでしょうか。  1つ目は、私の友人（参考文献はこちら：https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GkSHCb-X0AAGmJP?format=png&name=900x900）と一緒にビデオゲームをしていて、その友人がUmbrielの頭の上に寝ていて、お菓子を食べながらその様子をじっと見ているというもの。  もうひとつは、アンブリエルがベッドに横たわり、両腕を頭の後ろに回してくつろいでいるところで、私の友人（https://imgur.com/a/dfQn9vQ）がちっちゃくなってアンブリエルの胸の上に横たわり、気持ちよさそうに寄り添って抱きしめているところです。  本当にありがとう！", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kuruk89/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b11a9fa5/uploads/origins/c5262ee9-da65-4191-933b-823b6733061e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e93cf3a73b6237758978cecb10dff975", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b11a9fa5/uploads/origins/c5262ee9-da65-4191-933b-823b6733061e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e93cf3a73b6237758978cecb10dff975, https://si.imgix.net/b11a9fa5/uploads/origins/c5262ee9-da65-4191-933b-823b6733061e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=82b7d3ab14489f3d50e98066d11056ed 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b11a9fa5/uploads/origins/c5262ee9-da65-4191-933b-823b6733061e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3c83547e2ef0de1f61a2be9cedf9672b 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 765879, "client_id": 3134927, "nc": 16}, {"path": "/@kuruk89/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 765879, "client_id": 508654, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/34ec82a3/uploads/origins/c24b9c7d-ef2a-4661-8982-7131ac6238a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5eb0fbd48c91bdabde9a860219d734ae", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/34ec82a3/uploads/origins/c24b9c7d-ef2a-4661-8982-7131ac6238a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5eb0fbd48c91bdabde9a860219d734ae, https://si.imgix.net/34ec82a3/uploads/origins/c24b9c7d-ef2a-4661-8982-7131ac6238a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fde0a2d147aec7c7b550647bb0b74e0a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/34ec82a3/uploads/origins/c24b9c7d-ef2a-4661-8982-7131ac6238a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=20a024f592201c643e65417641852687 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/34ec82a3/uploads/origins/c24b9c7d-ef2a-4661-8982-7131ac6238a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=98a300910fb7920a457793f08a2c80a8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/34ec82a3/uploads/origins/c24b9c7d-ef2a-4661-8982-7131ac6238a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=98a300910fb7920a457793f08a2c80a8, https://si.imgix.net/34ec82a3/uploads/origins/c24b9c7d-ef2a-4661-8982-7131ac6238a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9658dc06424ccc8e46f421c64ec9b33f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/34ec82a3/uploads/origins/c24b9c7d-ef2a-4661-8982-7131ac6238a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d876044d4cba35244befd84263708dc7 3x"}, "body": "Hello again!\n\nI hope you don't mind if I make yet another request, I genuinely love your art and I can't help it, haha. It's almost my friend's birthday, so I felt the need to get him something nice!\n\nHe doesn't have any art of his characters of a human, so I was wondering if you would be alright working off of a furry reference and simply draw him AS a human? That would be awesome if so! The same goes for my character, I don't have any human art of him yet so if you could draw him as a human as well, that would be awesome!\n\nAgain, if you could draw them with size difference, that would be great! Ideally, something wholesome and cute, with my character as the giant and my friend's character as the tiny.\n\nHere's my character:\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/777980988844146738/873712671319523338/cl1-col.jpg\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/777980988844146738/873712689183088700/cl2-col.jpg\n\nHere's my friend's character (the red/black character):\nhttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E6SNOrjXIAc92ZT?format=jpg&name=4096x4096\n\nYou're also free to design my friend's clothing as you see fit!\n\nThank you so much and I look forward to hearing back from you!", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kuruk89/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 765879, "client_id": 508654, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/52da1cef/uploads/origins/49f27310-5c54-4356-9396-63d045de6438?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9113183e66929189e944a111ce17fa23", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/52da1cef/uploads/origins/49f27310-5c54-4356-9396-63d045de6438?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9113183e66929189e944a111ce17fa23, https://si.imgix.net/52da1cef/uploads/origins/49f27310-5c54-4356-9396-63d045de6438?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=054d2df8517906869b9083763c1c92d2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/52da1cef/uploads/origins/49f27310-5c54-4356-9396-63d045de6438?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c60eb51cc54c86c159cb2c78448e6096 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/52da1cef/uploads/origins/49f27310-5c54-4356-9396-63d045de6438?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=30a47eeccf5a675147da4fbe324e0775", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/52da1cef/uploads/origins/49f27310-5c54-4356-9396-63d045de6438?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=30a47eeccf5a675147da4fbe324e0775, https://si.imgix.net/52da1cef/uploads/origins/49f27310-5c54-4356-9396-63d045de6438?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=349b920b0bbc4b47ba893fdce10565aa 2x, https://si.imgix.net/52da1cef/uploads/origins/49f27310-5c54-4356-9396-63d045de6438?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7f73852f3f65db29c11b3509b7ca45cc 3x"}, "body": "また、こんにちは。\n\n何よりもまず、前回のリクエストにお礼を言いたいと思います。これ以上の喜びはありません。\n\n私の別のキャラクターと別の友人をテーマにした別の作品を作っていただけないでしょうか？^^\n\n前回の写真のように、一人のキャラクターが巨大で、もう一人のキャラクターが小さいというようなものだと嬉しいです。私のキャラクター(https://www.furaffinity.net/view/37331193/ || https://www.furaffinity.net/view/37535470/ || https://www.furaffinity.net/view/37179599/)が再び巨人になり、私の友人(https://www.deviantart.com/locemo/art/R-697176965)が小さなキャラクターになれないかと考えていました。\n\n芸術的な自由はいくらでもありますが、もし私の巨大なキャラクターがファッションデザイナーでランウェイモデルであることを中心に作品を作っていただけたら、素晴らしいことだと思います。\n\n私のキャラクターは、とてもプライドが高く、独りよがりで、ファッショナブルで、生意気ですが、彼のキャラクターは、もっと慌てていて、恥ずかしがり屋で、照れ屋などです。\n\n本当にありがとうございます！完成したリクエストを楽しみにしていますありがとうございました。", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kuruk89/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 765879, "client_id": 508654, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e272c1a8/uploads/origins/3ffdd182-e901-4ec3-9770-545ab88f8434?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=527695104f519471171f868dcfd72081", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e272c1a8/uploads/origins/3ffdd182-e901-4ec3-9770-545ab88f8434?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=527695104f519471171f868dcfd72081, https://si.imgix.net/e272c1a8/uploads/origins/3ffdd182-e901-4ec3-9770-545ab88f8434?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e2296d04faf33e1d820df03e54d14c00 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e272c1a8/uploads/origins/3ffdd182-e901-4ec3-9770-545ab88f8434?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7ed2c36775d0a04ef8f61dcd8dea1903 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e272c1a8/uploads/origins/3ffdd182-e901-4ec3-9770-545ab88f8434?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=93f3ae7033f5cb6e8edeabcede1d04d6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e272c1a8/uploads/origins/3ffdd182-e901-4ec3-9770-545ab88f8434?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=93f3ae7033f5cb6e8edeabcede1d04d6, https://si.imgix.net/e272c1a8/uploads/origins/3ffdd182-e901-4ec3-9770-545ab88f8434?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4ca61174d6aaeb59b43a56704807b87f 2x, htt